{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55486","headline":"句 四 · 李煜","name":"句 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金缸（疑当作「釭」）明五夜，玉盘罗八珍。\n（均见同书卷六。\n）（按：《唐音统签》卷七五四仅从《海录碎事》卷一补入「日映仙云薄，秋高天碧深」二句，《全唐诗》卷八仍之，以上八句均失收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}